			"notes": "##  Welcome to the Full Release (v1.0.0)\nThis release includes the ready-to-play compiled files for Minecraft versions across both **Java Edition 1.17 and newer** and **Bedrock Edition(26.2 and older)**.\n\n---\n\n###  Download Links by Minecraft Version\n\n####  Java Edition (1.21.2 to 26.2)\n* `ender_recipe_mod-fabric;forge1.21.2~26.2.jar` -> For **Fabric/Forge** users on 1.21.2 - 26.2 versions.\n* `ender_recipe_mod-neoforge1.21.2~26.2.jar` -> For **NeoForge** users on 1.21.2 - 26.2 versions.\n\n####  Java Edition (1.20.6 to 1.21.1)\n* `ender_recipe_mod-fabric;forge1.20.6~1.21.1.jar` -> For **Fabric/Forge** users on 1.20.6 - 1.21.1 versions.\n* `ender_recipe_mod-neoforge1.20.6~1.21.1.jar` -> For **NeoForge** users on 1.20.6 - 1.21.1 versions.\n\n####  Java Edition (1.20.5 and older)\n* `ender_recipe_mod-fabric;forge1.17~1.20.5.jar` -> For **Fabric/Forge** users on 1.17 - 1.20.5 versions.\n* `ender_recipe_mod-neoforge1.20.2~1.20.5.jar` -> For **NeoForge** users on 1.20.2 - 1.20.5 versions.\n\n####  Bedrock Edition \n* `ender_recipe_addon-bedrockedition.mcpack` -> For Bedrock Edition users on 26.2 and older versions(iOS, Android, Windows). Just download and open(iOS&Android) or double-click(Windows) to inport!\n\n---\n\n### 🛡️ Verified & Safe Download\nThis project is also registered and undergoing the official review process on Modrinth right now!\nThank you for playing! Feel free to report any issues or feedback on this repository."
